message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Certified multiobjective allocation with multiple reference profiles: reproducibility package"
type: software
version: 1.2.0
date-released: '2026-11-01'
authors:
  - family-names: Bezoui
    given-names: Madani
    affiliation: "CESI LINEACT (UR 7527), Campus de Nancy, France"
license: MIT
abstract: "Code, instance manifests and results for the exact optimization of a multiple-reference-profile (RMP) preference model over priority-optimal resource allocations: lexicographic coalition search, Pareto refinement, optimality certificates with an independent exact-arithmetic verifier, generic mixed-integer, epsilon-constraint and evolutionary comparators, and a demand-trace study of repeated decisions. Software is licensed under MIT; original results and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0."
keywords:
  - resource allocation
  - multiple criteria decision aiding
  - reference profiles
  - convex optimization
  - optimality certificates
